{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "104d0726-8480-8704-b471-b525c9f68567",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:32:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paulo Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:30:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Paulo Silva. I know it's after hours for City Hall, but I saw this number was the storm line so I figured I'd try it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 52 Bliss Road, over by Easton's Beach. After the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, two days ago, the street in front of my house turned into a pond. It's still mostly there. Cars come through and throw wakes up onto the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:30:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 52 Bliss Road, standing water in the street since the storm. Got it. Is it getting into any yards or houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:30:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not into the house. Up to the edge of the driveway, though. This keeps happening when we get a hard rain and nothing gets done about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Anything else you noticed out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. There's a manhole cover near the curb that looks off by about an inch. Like it's sitting higher on one side. Might be nothing, but I'd rather somebody look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, I'll put that in the notes. Manhole cover sitting uneven, near the flooded spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So will a work order get opened? And for what date? I'd like an actual date, not just that it's noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can open the order tonight, so it's in the system with the date of today, the eighth. As for when a crew gets out there, I can't give you a day. They're working through a pile after the storm. The order goes to the drainage crew and they'll prioritize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I get the order number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me finish entering it and I'll read it to you. Okay, I've got it. Is 401-555-0186 the best number if they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, the order is in. Anything else, Paulo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. I appreciate a polite voice on the phone. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T19:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Stay dry out there."
    }
  ],
